# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and on checkout, so tooling
# stays consistent across platforms. Biome enforces LF, and CI runs on Linux;
# without this, a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) has CRLF working files
# and `pnpm lint` reports every file as a formatting error locally while CI is
# green. `text=auto` still leaves git-detected binary files untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
